    "title": "OPINION: Torturous and nerve-shredding - Arteta and Arsenal have made it worth every second - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tolga Akdeniz ,\n13 hours ago I was desperate for the title race to end on Tuesday night. I don't think I could bear it going to the final game. After back-to-back 1-0 wins against West Ham and Burnley, my nerves had been shredded. The win at the London Stadium was one of the most painful experiences I have ever had watching sport. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
